<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Commercial Vehicles Licensing Board (Amendment) Act 2024. New section 41a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@> .
