<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any proceedings commenced or pending immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, after the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/eng@> .
